  ASSET GENERATION
  CODE ANALYSIS (SonarQube)
  CODE QUALITY (Biome)
  DEPLOYMENT
  FULL PIPELINE
  GIT & i18n SYNC
  i18n TRANSLATION TOOLS
                        (install → build → gallery → sitemap → test → deploy)
    make all            Complete fresh-to-production pipeline
    make android:build  Build debug APK
    make android:bump   Bump version code and name
    make android        Full production build (bump + release AAB)
    make android:init   Initialize Android platform (run once)
    make android:keystore Generate release keystore (run once)
    make android:open   Open in Android Studio
    make android:release Build release AAB for Play Store
    make android:run    Run on connected device/emulator
    make android:sync   Sync web assets to Android project
    make android:upload Full build + upload AAB to Play Store
    make build          Build production bundle
    make check          Check all without changes (for CI)
    make clean          Remove dist, node_modules, and Android build files
    make dep            Generate dependency graph (deps.png)
    make deploy         Deploy to Netlify (anqr.link)
    make dev            Start development server
    make fix            Fix all: format, lint with auto-fix, organize imports
    make format         Format only (no linting)
    make gallery:auto        Full pipeline: scan matrix → copy approved → gallery manifest
    make gallery:auto   Run scan matrix → copy approved artifacts to gallery
    make gallery:fresh  Clean + regenerate all gallery images from scratch
    make gallery        Generate gallery images (PNG)
    make gallery:gif    Generate gallery images (with GIFs)
    make hooks          Install git hooks (lefthook + commitlint + lint-staged)
    make i18n:check              Check i18n regressions vs baseline
    make i18n:fill               Generate TS/JSON from all txt files
      make i18n:fill LANGS="en-GB fr-FR"
    make i18n:fill:locales       Generate locales JSON files only
    make i18n:fill:static        Generate static TS files only
    make i18n:pull      Pull translations from public anqr-i18n repo
    make i18n:push      Push translations to public anqr-i18n repo
      make i18n:xlate LANGS="fr-FR de-DE"
    make i18n:xlate:locales      Translate UI strings only
    make i18n:xlate:static       Translate static content only
    make i18n:xlate              Translate all languages (static + locales)
    make icons:android  Generate Android launcher icons
    make icons          Generate PWA icons
    make install        Install npm dependencies + git hooks
    make lint           Lint only (no formatting)
    make pull           Pull from origin + pull i18n translations
    make push           Push i18n translations + push to origin
    make quality        Run comprehensive quality gate (19 checks: lint, types, coverage, deps, security, spelling, bundle)
    make report:payload:matrix Generate per-kind payload wiring verification report
    make resources      Show auto-detected CPU/mem/disk tuning values
    make signoff        Run full production sign-off checker
    make sitemap        Generate sitemap.xml
    make sonar-report   Get full issues report from SonarQube
    make sonar          Run SonarQube analysis (requires local server)
    make test:advanced  Run advanced tier UI tests only
    make test:basic     Run basic tier UI tests only
    make test:bundle:budget Build + enforce bundle budgets (main/non-i18n/i18n)
    make test:coverage:gap  Generate coverage debt report
    make test:gallery:matrix Run sharded gallery scan matrix across 4 fixtures x 2 tiers
    make test:ids       Generate canonical tests/ids.txt inventory
    make test:overlay:audit  Run overlay preservation wiring audit (heavyweight, ~2min)
    make test:permutations  Run ONLY exhaustive permutation tests
    make test:pro       Run professional tier UI tests only
    make test:qr:artifact  Run dithered scan gate and save current tsunami/king artifacts
    make test:report        Show HTML test report
    make test:required:gap  Generate required mapping debt report
    make test:required  Generate tests/required.txt requirement matrix
    make test:required:strict  Fail if requirements are not direct-id backed
    make test           Run ALL tests: comprehensive quality gates + full unit suite + E2E
    make test:testid:refs  Validate tests only use managed test IDs
    make test:tiers     Run tier tests only (excludes permutations)
    make test:ui        Open Playwright UI mode
    make test:unit:ci   Run CI-safe Vitest subset (excludes missing local fixture tests)
    make test:unit:coverage  Run Vitest with strict 100% coverage gate
    make test:unit      Run all Vitest unit tests
    make zip            Create git archive zip of the project
